    "body": "I think this could benefit from some discussion with users, if possible. It kind of depends how much people expect these sort of strings to be \"path-like\" (where `./foo` is equivalent to `foo`) or \"regexp-like\", and how inserting `:bar` in various locations changes their intuition. I don't have much of a handle on that...",
